{"id":"dd6d5729a326908a","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-colored-graph.md","title":"有限彩色图与着色扩张","display":"df-colored-graph — 有限彩色图与着色扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-colored-graph","aliases":["29-df-colored-graph"],"display":"df-colored-graph — 有限彩色图与着色扩张","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.2, p.182, DjVu scan 197","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-colored-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-colored-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-colored-graph — 有限彩色图与着色扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.2, p.182, DjVu scan 197"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\geq r\">\\(s\\geq r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式取无向简单图约定；颜色是任意一元关系，不预设互斥或穷尽。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]\">\\(G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]\\)</span>，结构类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;(\\neg E^G(u,u)\\land(E^G(u,v)\\leftrightarrow E^G(v,u)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;(\\neg E^G(u,u)\\land(E^G(u,v)\\leftrightarrow E^G(v,u)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Col}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\mid v\\in C_i^G\\},\\qquad v\\in|G|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Col}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\mid v\\in C_i^G\\},\\qquad v\\in|G|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}(G,H)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\land H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\land H\\upharpoonright\\tau_r=G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}(G,H)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\land H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\land H\\upharpoonright\\tau_r=G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.2，印刷页 182，扫描页 197。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个任意一元谓词允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^r\">\\(2^r\\)</span> 种颜色组合，不能默认为恰好 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个互斥颜色。这里逐个有限词汇写出图类和着色扩张，避免把原书可数颜色总词汇直接塞进本库的有限 Vocabulary 类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时恢复无色图。对有向图可另行取消对称和无环条件，本条未作该扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下式取无向简单图约定；颜色是任意一元关系，不预设互斥或穷尽。$G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]$，结构类见 [[29-df-struc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s\\geq r","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_r]\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;(\\neg E^G(u,u)\\land(E^G(u,v)\\leftrightarrow E^G(v,u)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Col}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\mid v\\in C_i^G\\},\\qquad v\\in|G|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Coloring}_{r,s}(G,H)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\land H\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_s\\land H\\upharpoonright\\tau_r=G.","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"2^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"r=0","display":false}],"bytes":1608,"backlinks":[{"id":"11a305a5b8299748","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r\\geq0$，$G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$，$k\\geq1$；$\\operatorname{Col}_G$ 见 [[29-df-colored-graph]]。"},{"id":"bd0a5970265c8091","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b961a724325c53e7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]、[[29-df-color-class-size]]、[[29-df-graph-canonization]] — 彩色图、色类上界与规范化"},{"id":"a4c575bb1780ff55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$，$G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$，$n=|V|\\geq1$；$\\operatorname{Col}_G$ 取 [[29-df-colored-graph]]。"},{"id":"531861035d8c6707","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$ 为 [[29-df-colored-graph]] 的非空有限无向简单彩色图类，颜色谓词可以重叠。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-colored-graph]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-colored-graph|29-df-colored-graph]]"}],"outgoing":["0ac4b9a122d458e2","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}